\begin{description}
\item[* name:] RBPROPERNOUNtoSUBNOUN
\item[* relevant examples:] John (The John that I was referring to)
\item[* language:] (Dutch, English, Spanish) English
\item[* kind of rule:] (M-rule, S-rule, Transferrule) M-rule
\item[* subgrammar:] NPderivation
\item[* class:] (name of rule, transformation or filter class)
\item[* date of creation:] 3-MAY-1989
