\item[* copied from:] Dutch RBPROPERNOUNtoSUBNOUN
\item[* modification:]\mbox{}
\begin{enumerate}
\item date: ../../..\ \ \ \ \ author:
\item date: ../../..\ \ \ \ \ author:
\end{enumerate}
\item[* task:] to convert a BPROPERNOUN into a SUBNOUN, since only singular 
bpropernouns may become propernoun; all plural forms are made through conversion 
to SUBNOUN. Modification of (singular) propernouns at the CN level also 
requires a prior conversion to SUBNOUNs (PROPERNOUNS have no CN level).
