\begin{description}
\item[* name:] CNmodposs3
\item[* relevant examples:]\mbox{}\\
1. book my father (via NPformation $\rightarrow$ my father's book)\\
2. book I ($\rightarrow$ my book)\\
3. book everybody ($\rightarrow$ everybody's book)\\
4. book John ($\rightarrow$ John's book)\\
5. book who ($\rightarrow$ whose book)
\item[* language:] English
\item[* kind of rule:] (M-rule, S-rule, Transferrule) M-rule
\item[* subgrammar:] CN-subgrammar
\item[* class:] (name of rule, transformation or filter class) modpossrules
\item[* date of creation:] 19-MAR-1988 15:37:20  
\item[* author:] Franciska de Jong
