\item[* modification:]\mbox{}
\begin{enumerate}
\item date: ../../..\ \ \ \ \ author:
\item date: ../../..\ \ \ \ \ author:
\end{enumerate}
\item[* task:]
Introduction of possessive modifiers that end up in prenominal position
via NPformation.  \\ \\
(Compare the semantically equivalent rule CNmodposs1: book {\em of\/} my
father('s), book of mine, etc.)
